WEBVTT

00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:00.482
to talk about these issues:

00:03:01.227 --> 00:03:04.834
CVID, ICBM, JCPOA.

00:03:05.782 --> 00:03:08.909
It's really inaccessible
for a lot of people.

00:03:09.678 --> 00:03:13.312
And, in reality, it actually sometimes
I think makes us numb

00:03:13.336 --> 00:03:15.614
to what we're really talking about here.

00:03:16.843 --> 00:03:19.494
And what we are really talking about here

00:03:19.518 --> 00:03:20.669
is the fact that,

00:03:20.693 --> 00:03:23.933
while we've made dramatic reductions
in the number of nuclear weapons

00:03:23.957 --> 00:03:25.344
since the Cold War,

00:03:25.368 --> 00:03:30.693
right now, there are almost 15,000
in the world today.